{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-tek-squad-5000-mah-portable-power-bank-2511-0116","content_id":"686e225f-14a5-4a3a-bb9d-d42bad44f797","description":"Product Recall for Tek Squad 5000 MAH Portable Power Bank presenting a risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"79f4aa74-7de6-4eb4-9d5b-c96e849d9234","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-18T13:08:25+00:00","id":"79f4aa74-7de6-4eb4-9d5b-c96e849d9234","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-03-18T13:08:25+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69baa3c9511897e6c6fd6183/2511-0116-product-recall-tek-squad-power-bank.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Tek Squad 5000 MAH Portable Power Bank</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire as the internal wiring is not securely attached. This could lead to wires loosening during use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Chargers</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Tek Squad</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>789949316983</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Receipt and Price Ticket Codes</td>\n      <td>002950, 002951, 002953, 017519, 017521, 017522, 022099, 022100</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model Numbers</td>\n      <td>41251, 41253, 41259</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Portable power bank available in various colours sold via TK Maxx between July 2025 and January 2026.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_79f4aa74-7de6-4eb4-9d5b-c96e849d9234\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69baa3c9511897e6c6fd6183/2511-0116-product-recall-tek-squad-power-bank.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire as the internal wiring is not securely attached. This could lead to wires loosening during use. Loose wiring may cause the product to short-circuit, overheat and catch fire.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<p>If you have purchased this product, please stop using it immediately and return to any TK Maxx store for a full refund or replacement. For more information, please access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.tkmaxx.com/uk/en/l/product-recall\">https://www.tkmaxx.com/uk/en/l/product-recall</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0116</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-18T16:36:07Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-18","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_aler